"hm-example">Example data</span></div><ul class="hm-checks"><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Monthly receivables snapshot</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Certified</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">Captured on the 1st · 12-month trend</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Processor to case system</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">2,013 matched · 759 queued for a person</span></li><li class="is-flagged"><span class="hm-checks__name">Contracts marked paid with no payments</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--warn">Flagged</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">428 found with ~4% collected · reclassified, reversible</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Duplicate and orphan clients</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">561 contracts re-linked · 89 duplicates merged</span></li><li><span class="hm-checks__name">Double-booking guard</span><span class="hm-chip hm-chip--ok">Healthy</span><span class="hm-checks__meta">A retried payment can&#x27;t be booked twice</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="<?php echo esc_url( lexcollect_page_url( 'platform' ) ); ?>">Explore the full platform <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section section--light hm-loop" id="connect"><div class="container"><div class="hm-loop__head" data-reveal="true"><p class="eyebrow">Every family heard</p><h2>From “they stopped answering” to a plan the family can keep.</h2><p class="lead">One account, four steps, a record at every one. A partner can see what happened without asking.</p></div><div class="hm-loop__grid" data-scrolly="true"><ol class="hm-loop__steps"><li class="hm-step is-active" data-step="queue"><span class="hm-step__num">01</span><h3>Queue</h3><p>Late accounts are ranked by balance, age and last contact, built from reconciled balances. Consult-only and junk records stay 